title: "coauthored: AI co-authorship trailers in AI infrastructure repositories, 2023–2026"
abstract: >-
  Counts commits that carry an explicit AI attribution and measures that share
  month by month in open-source AI infrastructure repositories, matched non-AI
  repositories and coding-agent harnesses. Code: Apache-2.0. Data: CC-BY-4.0.
